  "releaseNotes": "v7.0.0-rc2 — Fix backward compatibility regression: UseTableBoundSelector<T>().Select(expr, alias) was treating the alias as a table name prefix instead of a column alias, producing broken SQL (e.g. Alias.Column instead of Table.Column AS Alias). Namespace-only migration from Rocket.Libraries.QBuilder now works correctly at runtime.",
